+    <tr><td>Proof-sized answers</td><td>AnswerPacket returns claim, support, construction, falsifier/proof status, and rollback path.</td><td>Less rambling output; more checkable knowledge.</td><td><span class="tag partial">AnswerPacket live · citation badges pending</span></td></tr>
